      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Anti-epileptic drugs are being used to treat a variety of conditions. This column provides an overview of the potential uses of the new AEDs. More randomized, clinical trials are needed before considering the new AEDs as first-line therapy for non-seizure disorders, but these agents appear to be emerging as potential options for a variety of conditions."},
